WEBVTT

NOTE Text follows SCRIPT-v3.md. Cue times are Whisper (small.en) word timestamps on the final audio, checked against ffmpeg silencedetect.

00:00.450 --> 00:04.930
What if your software understood you,
instead of you having to learn it?

00:05.060 --> 00:07.450
In 2026, it can.

00:07.980 --> 00:12.370
I'm Ramachandran, co-founder
and CEO of Xentovia AI.

00:12.620 --> 00:16.400
For thirty years, I ran supply
chains across four countries,

00:16.440 --> 00:21.350
and I saw good people lose hours to
paperwork and complicated systems.

00:22.120 --> 00:24.940
Most software expects you to learn it.

00:24.980 --> 00:27.140
People are nervous of
pressing the wrong button,

00:27.180 --> 00:30.450
and new staff can take
months to settle in.

00:30.560 --> 00:34.370
So the work stays on paper,
on calls, and on WhatsApp.

00:35.080 --> 00:38.030
At Xentovia, we build AI agents.

00:38.340 --> 00:40.340
You just tell the agent what you need,

00:40.380 --> 00:45.350
by voice, on WhatsApp, or with a
photo, and it does the computer work.

00:45.780 --> 00:50.690
A photo of a handwritten register becomes
digital records, ready for checking.

00:50.940 --> 00:54.710
A bill sent on WhatsApp is
checked and sent for approval.

00:54.820 --> 00:58.890
A call at nine at night is
answered, and the booking is taken.

00:59.540 --> 01:01.170
And you stay in charge.

01:01.560 --> 01:04.550
You decide which steps
need a person's approval.

01:05.220 --> 01:07.250
Small shop or large enterprise,

01:07.540 --> 01:11.090
you start with one task that
takes too much of your day.

01:11.680 --> 01:14.690
Behind this is decades
of business experience,

01:14.800 --> 01:18.510
and AI engineers with more than
ten years in the industry.

01:18.960 --> 01:22.950
This is where business software is
heading, and we're building it today.

01:23.450 --> 01:27.350
Tell us one task you'd like off
your desk, and let's start there.

01:27.580 --> 01:28.800
Thank you.
